940	    /**
941	     * The status on the given day once the given amount has been paid against the grand total at the
942	     * tax rate: a sent invoice with something still due more than {@link #GRACE_DAYS} days after its
943	     * due date is overdue, part paid or not. Held retention is never due, so never makes it overdue;
944	     * released retention is due {@link #RETENTION_DUE_DAYS} days after its release, and payments go to
945	     * the rest of the invoice before it. An invoice spread over instalments is instead overdue when any
946	     * of its instalments is (see {@link #instalmentProgress}).
947	     */
948	    public InvoiceStatus statusWhenPaid(BigDecimal paid, BigDecimal taxRate, LocalDate today) {
949	        return statusWhenPaid(paid, null, taxRate, today);
950	    }
